Place your app icon PNG files here before building for production:

- icon.png            — 1024×1024 (Play Store listing icon)
- adaptive-foreground.png — 1024×1024 (Android adaptive icon, transparent background)
- splash-icon.png     — 1284×2778 (splash screen artwork)

You can generate these with:
- https://icon.kitchen (free, generates all sizes)
- https://www.canva.com (for quick designs)
- Or hire a designer

After placing the files, run: npx expo optimize